{"seq":2,"slug":"academic-writing","title":"学术写作","stage":"DONE","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/common-foundations/academic-writing","introMarkdown":"# 学术写作 简介\n\n学术写作是研究生将思考转化为可交流学术成果的核心能力。无论是学位论文、期刊文章还是课题申报书，清晰、严谨、有说服力的表达都是成果获得认可的必要条件。掌握学术写作不仅关乎文字技巧，更关乎思维训练和学术规范的内化。\n\n本课程从写作基本功出发，经由论文结构规范、多种学术文体的写作实践，最终到达修改与发表的完整链路，共设四个章节，引导学习者系统提升学术表达能力。\n\n第一章**学术写作基础**奠定写作的底层功夫。学术文体风格的把握让行文兼顾精确与可读，论证逻辑的训练确保观点立得住、推理经得起推敲，引用规范的掌握则是学术诚信的基本体现。\n\n第二章**论文结构与规范**深入论文各核心部分的撰写要领。摘要与引言如何快速传达研究价值，方法论部分怎样描述才能保证可复现性，结果与讨论如何在数据呈现与理论对话之间取得平衡——这些都是决定论文质量的关键节点。\n\n第三章**学术文体与体裁**拓展写作的应用场景。期刊论文、学术会议论文和课题申报书各有独特的体例要求和审阅标准，了解这些差异有助于学习者在不同学术交流场景中游刃有余。\n\n第四章**修改与发表策略**覆盖从初稿到正式发表的完整流程。自我编辑的系统方法、期刊选择与投稿策略、以及如何回复审稿意见，这些实战技能往往是研究生在投稿过程中最需要的指导。\n\n建议学习者按章节顺序推进，同时将自己正在撰写的论文或报告作为练习素材，在实践中消化各章内容。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"writing-foundations","title":"学术写作基础","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/common-foundations/academic-writing/writing-foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"academic-style","title":"研究生 学术写作 — 学术文体风格","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/common-foundations/academic-writing/writing-foundations/academic-style"},{"seq":2,"slug":"argumentation-logic","title":"研究生 学术写作 — 论证逻辑","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/common-foundations/academic-writing/writing-foundations/argumentation-logic"},{"seq":3,"slug":"citation-standards","title":"研究生 学术写作 — 引用规范","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/common-foundations/academic-writing/writing-foundations/citation-standards"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"paper-structure","title":"论文结构与规范","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/common-foundations/academic-writing/paper-structure","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"abstract-introduction","title":"研究生 学术写作 — 摘要与引言撰写","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/common-foundations/academic-writing/paper-structure/abstract-introduction"},{"seq":2,"slug":"methodology-section","title":"研究生 学术写作 — 方法论部分撰写","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/common-foundations/academic-writing/paper-structure/methodology-section"},{"seq":3,"slug":"results-discussion","title":"研究生 学术写作 — 结果与讨论撰写","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/common-foundations/academic-writing/paper-structure/results-discussion"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"genres","title":"学术文体与体裁","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/common-foundations/academic-writing/genres","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"journal-articles","title":"研究生 学术写作 — 期刊论文写作","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/common-foundations/academic-writing/genres/journal-articles"},{"seq":2,"slug":"conference-papers","title":"研究生 学术写作 — 学术会议论文","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/common-foundations/academic-writing/genres/conference-papers"},{"seq":3,"slug":"grant-proposals","title":"研究生 学术写作 — 课题申报书写作","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/common-foundations/academic-writing/genres/grant-proposals"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"revision-publishing","title":"修改与发表策略","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/common-foundations/academic-writing/revision-publishing","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"revision-strategies","title":"研究生 学术写作 — 修改策略与自我编辑","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/common-foundations/academic-writing/revision-publishing/revision-strategies"},{"seq":2,"slug":"journal-selection","title":"研究生 学术写作 — 期刊选择与投稿策略","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/common-foundations/academic-writing/revision-publishing/journal-selection"},{"seq":3,"slug":"response-to-reviewers","title":"研究生 学术写作 — 审稿意见回复与修改","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/common-foundations/academic-writing/revision-publishing/response-to-reviewers"}]}]}